    "description": "<h4>FreeDMR Network.</h4>\r\n<p>The FreeDMR Network is a group of independent servers running the FreeDMR Peer Server Software. The FreeDMR Peer Servers are connected via OpenBridge &ldquo;OPB&rdquo; connections in a Mesh topology to one another to redundantly and diversely share all available TalkGroups among all Servers. The FreeDMR Network, does NOT utilize a &ldquo;Master/Slave&rdquo; topology. All FreeDMR peer servers are seen as equal peers to each other just as all the individuals who run the servers are. We do not control when where, what how or who can use our software. Free means free as in speech and free as in beer!.</p>"
